---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Eduardo Kalil — Kalil Data Solutions">
  <section class="mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 md:py-20">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="max-w-3xl">
        <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-zinc-500">
          Analista de Dados · BI · Automação com Python
        </p>

        <h1 class="mt-4 text-5xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-zinc-900 sm:text-6xl">
          Transformando dados em decisões claras e acionáveis
        </h1>

        <p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-base leading-7 text-zinc-600">
          Crio dashboards, automações e soluções de dados com foco em clareza,
          eficiência operacional e apoio à tomada de decisão.
        </p>

        <p class="mt-3 text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">
          Power BI · SQL · Python · Looker Studio · PostgreSQL
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          <a
            href="/projetos"
            class="rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800"
          >
            Ver projetos
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://linkedin.com/in/eduardokalil"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800 transition hover:bg-zinc-50"
          >
            LinkedIn
          </a>

          <a
            href="https://github.com/EduardoJKN"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noreferrer"
            class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-800 transition hover:bg-zinc-50"
          >
            GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-gradient-to-br from-white to-zinc-50 p-6 shadow-sm">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-5">
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Resumo do portfólio</p>

          <div class="mt-6 grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Projetos</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900">6+</p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Foco</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900">Impacto</p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Stack</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900">
                BI · SQL · Python
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="rounded-2xl bg-zinc-50 p-4">
              <p class="text-xs text-zinc-500">Áreas</p>
              <p class="mt-1 text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900">
                Fiscal · Marketing
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-5 rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 p-4">
            <p class="text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-zinc-500">
              Proposta de valor
            </p>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-700">
              Projetos construídos para transformar dados brutos em leitura clara,
              automação útil e decisões mais rápidas.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 border-t border-zinc-100 pt-14">
      <div class="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3">
        <a
          href="/projetos?cat=bi"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 transition group-hover:text-zinc-700">
                Dashboards
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">
                KPIs e visuais com foco em leitura rápida, acompanhamento de performance
                e apoio à decisão.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500">
                Power BI · Looker Studio · Tableau
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-lg text-zinc-400 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-zinc-700">
              →
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/projetos?cat=auto"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 transition group-hover:text-zinc-700">
                Automação
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">
                Rotinas com Python, APIs, webhooks, scraping e alertas para reduzir
                esforço manual e acelerar processos.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500">
                Python · Telegram · Web scraping
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-lg text-zinc-400 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-zinc-700">
              →
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>

        <a
          href="/projetos?cat=sql"
          class="group rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm transition duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-zinc-300 hover:shadow-md"
        >
          <div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-lg font-semibold text-zinc-900 transition group-hover:text-zinc-700">
                Modelagem
              </h3>
              <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-6 text-zinc-600">
                SQL, estrutura analítica e organização de dados para bases mais
                confiáveis e análises consistentes.
              </p>
              <p class="mt-4 text-xs font-medium text-zinc-500">
                SQL · ETL/ELT · Qualidade
              </p>
            </div>
            <span class="text-lg text-zinc-400 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:text-zinc-700">
              →
            </span>
          </div>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section class="mt-16">
      <div class="mb-5 flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Projeto em destaque</p>
          <h2 class="mt-1 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-900">
            Análise Pareto ABC com PostgreSQL e Power BI
          </h2>
        </div>

        <a
          href="/projetos/pareto-abc"
          class="text-sm font-semibold text-zinc-900 transition hover:text-zinc-700"
        >
          Ver case →
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="grid gap-6 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm md:grid-cols-[1.2fr,0.8fr]">
        <div class="overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50">
          <img
            src="/img/projetos/pareto-abc/pareto-valor.png"
            alt="Projeto Pareto ABC com PostgreSQL e Power BI"
            class="h-full w-full object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
          <p class="text-sm leading-7 text-zinc-600">
            Dashboard desenvolvido para identificar quais estados concentram a maior
            parte do faturamento e dos pedidos, com ranking progressivo, acumulado,
            classificação ABC e apoio de modelagem analítica em SQL/PostgreSQL.
          </p>

          <div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-2">
            <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-zinc-700">
              Power BI
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-zinc-700">
              PostgreSQL
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-zinc-700">
              SQL
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-zinc-700">
              DAX
            </span>
            <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-zinc-50 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-zinc-700">
              Modelagem
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-6">
            <a
              href="/projetos/pareto-abc"
              class="inline-flex rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-zinc-800"
            >
              Explorar projeto
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="mt-16 rounded-3xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white p-8 shadow-sm">
      <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Experiência aplicada</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900">
            Cases reais + projetos autorais
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Stacks principais</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900">
            Power BI · SQL · Python
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-medium text-zinc-500">Objetivo</p>
          <p class="mt-2 text-2xl font-extrabold text-zinc-900">
            Clareza, automação e impacto
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>